---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageShell from "../../components/layout/PageShell.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Discord Community"
  canonical="/discord/"
  description="Join the AI Village Discord community for AI security research discussion, events, journal clubs, roles, and community support."
>
  <PageShell>
  <h1>Discord Community</h1>
  <div class="discord-hero">
    <h2>Join the AI Village Discord</h2>
    <p>Connect with researchers, hackers, and AI security enthusiasts from around the world.</p>
    <div class="discord-hero__actions">
      <a class="discord-button" href="https://discord.com/invite/rDhxjWa69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">🎮 Join Discord Server</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <hr />
  <h2>🚀 Getting Started</h2>
  <div class="card card--accent-primary">
    <h3 class="text-accent mt-0">📝 First Steps</h3>
    <ol class="discord-steps">
      <li><strong>Join the server</strong> using the link above</li>
      <li><strong>Introduce yourself</strong> in the <code>#start-here</code> channel</li>
      <li><strong>Get the "Villager" role</strong> from a community member</li>
      <li><strong>Explore channels</strong> and find your interests</li>
      <li><strong>Participate</strong> in discussions and events</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="content-note">
      <p class="mb-0"><strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> When you first join, you'll only have access to <code>#start-here</code>. Drop a note introducing yourself, and someone will give you the "Villager" role for full access!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <hr />
  <h2>📋 Community Guidelines</h2>
  <div class="responsive-grid responsive-grid--wide">
    <div class="card"><h4 class="text-risk mt-0">🚫 Basic Rules</h4><ul class="discord-list"><li>Stay on topic in specialized channels</li><li>No NSFW content permitted</li><li>No illegal behavior or solicitation</li><li>No spamming or channel disruption</li><li>Follow the AI Village <a href="/about/conduct/">Code of Conduct</a></li></ul></div>
    <div class="card"><h4 class="text-warning mt-0">💬 Communication</h4><ul class="discord-list"><li>Use threads for long discussions</li><li>Take off-topic conversations to #general</li><li>Be respectful and constructive</li><li>Help newcomers get oriented</li><li>Share knowledge and resources</li></ul></div>
  </div>
  <hr />
  <h2>🏆 Community Roles</h2>
  <div class="role-hierarchy my-2">
    <div class="role-card discord-role-card discord-role-card--muted"><h4>👤 Villager</h4><p>Basic member role with access to most channels. Granted after introduction in #start-here.</p></div>
    <div class="role-card discord-role-card discord-role-card--field"><h4>⭐ ElderVillager</h4><p>Active community members who have contributed talks, workshops, or sustained participation. Can invite new members and promote to Villager role.</p></div>
    <div class="role-card discord-role-card discord-role-card--warning"><h4>🛡️ Officer</h4><p>Community leaders who have organized substantial events or content. Have moderation powers and can help establish new initiatives.</p></div>
    <div class="role-card discord-role-card discord-role-card--risk"><h4>👑 Board</h4><p>AI Village board members with full moderation powers. Contact for harassment issues or code of conduct violations.</p></div>
  </div>
  <hr />
  <h2>🎯 Popular Channels</h2>
  <div class="responsive-grid responsive-grid--wide">
    {["#general:General discussion and off-topic conversations", "#research:AI security research discussions and paper reviews", "#events:Announcements and discussions about upcoming events", "#tools-and-code:Sharing tools, code, and technical resources", "#job-board:AI security job postings and career discussions", "#ctf-discussion:CTF announcements, team formation, and writeups"].map((item) => {
      const [name, text] = item.split(":");
      return <div class="card"><h4 class="mt-0">{name}</h4><p>{text}</p></div>;
    })}
  </div>
  <hr />
  <h2>📅 Regular Events</h2>
  <div class="events-grid my-2">
    <div class="card card--center"><h4 class="text-warning mt-0">📚 Hacker Journal Club</h4><p class="text-muted text-mono">Wednesdays at 5 PM PST / 8 PM EST</p><p>Discuss academic papers with industry perspective, covering everything from ML security to policy.</p></div>
    <div class="card card--center"><h4 class="text-warning mt-0">🔒 Privacy & Ethics Journal Club</h4><p class="text-muted text-mono">Tuesdays at 5 PM PST / 8 PM EST</p><p>Interdisciplinary analysis of AI systems from theoretical and practical perspectives.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card card--accent-primary">
    <h4 class="text-accent mt-0">📅 Event Updates</h4>
    <p>Use the events archive for upcoming AI Village appearances and past schedules.</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a class="text-accent text-strong" href="/events/">View AI Village events</a></p>
  </div>
  <hr />
  <h2>❓ Need Help?</h2>
  <div class="card card--accent-risk">
    <h4 class="text-risk mt-0">🆘 Support & Issues</h4>
    <p>If you experience harassment or have concerns about community behavior:</p>
    <ul><li><strong>Contact Officers or Board members</strong> directly via DM</li><li><strong>Use the server reporting system</strong> for serious issues</li><li><strong>Remember:</strong> We have zero tolerance for harassment</li></ul>
    <p class="mb-0">Our community is dedicated to providing a safe and welcoming environment for everyone.</p>
  </div>
  </PageShell>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .discord-hero {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .discord-hero h2 {
    color: var(--aiv-action-primary);
  }

  .discord-hero p {
    color: var(--aiv-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .discord-hero__actions {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .discord-button {
    background: var(--aiv-brand-discord-bg);
    border-radius: 5px;
    color: var(--aiv-brand-discord-text);
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .discord-button:hover {
    color: var(--aiv-brand-discord-text);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .discord-steps {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .discord-list {
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .discord-role-card {
    background: var(--aiv-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--aiv-card-border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--aiv-text-muted);
    border-radius: 0 5px 5px 0;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .discord-role-card h4 {
    color: var(--aiv-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .discord-role-card p {
    color: var(--aiv-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .discord-role-card--field {
    border-left-color: var(--aiv-accent-field);
  }

  .discord-role-card--field h4 {
    color: var(--aiv-accent-field);
  }

  .discord-role-card--warning {
    border-left-color: var(--aiv-warning);
  }

  .discord-role-card--warning h4 {
    color: var(--aiv-warning);
  }

  .discord-role-card--risk {
    border-left-color: var(--aiv-risk);
  }

  .discord-role-card--risk h4 {
    color: var(--aiv-risk);
  }
</style>
